{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026f82rreelwg1793258071.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超和相關官員今日（十月二十九日）下午二時四十五分，在添馬添美道二號政府總部地下演講廳，舉行有關就大埔宏福苑火災成立的獨立委員會報告相關事宜的記者會。李家超表示：「對宏福苑火災發生，導致168人死亡，包括一位英勇救火犧牲的消防員，帶給災民悲痛，我作為行政長官，政府之首，深感難過。我代表特區政府，向災民和廣大市民，表示道歉。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:54.397544+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:58.784345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:24.063192+00:00","content_hash":"77e0bbda3adf760385c32f22c0f8f693ffaf368f271a6dc9e7d519857f08e77f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:54.397544+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}